[[File:LoricaLightsaber.jpg|thumb|right|200px|A lightsaber was a type of weapon used in the galaxy.]]
A '''weapon''' was a device used to [[Death|kill]] or damage living beings, vehicles, structures, or terrain. Types of weapons used in [[the galaxy]] included [[melee weapon]]s, [[blaster]]s, [[flamethrower]]s, and [[missile launcher]]s. Weapons with a [[stun]] setting could be used to disable [[Sentience|sentient]] beings without killing them.<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

Some weapons fired high energy [[laser]]s or energized particles to harm their target. Other weapons fired explosive or ballistic projectiles for damage. Still other weapons were used to bash, stab, or slash their targets. [[Lightsaber]]s had the distinctive quality among melee weapons that they could be used to deflect blaster bolts back to their source.<ref name="Episode IV" />

Some weapons, known as [[superweapon]]s, had the destructive power to destroy entire [[planet]]s.<ref name="DS Superlaser DB">{{Databank|death-star-superlaser|Death Star Superlaser}}</ref>

{{Weapon-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Weapons first appeared in the [[1977]] motion picture [[Star Wars: Episode IV A New Hope|''Star Wars'': Episode IV ''A New Hope'']].<ref name="Episode IV" />

